# Checkpoints are downloaded, not vendored. The exported .onnx files ARE
# committed -- they are the plugin's payload. The three warp graphs are ~1 MiB
# together; light_inpaint_v1.onnx is 9.2 MiB on its own, which is 2.26M
# parameters in fp32 and is simply what that model weighs.
*.pth

# Regenerable by export_onnx.py, and large.
models/reference.npz

